OL,3,AHidden tongue movement found in 'strong
OL,4,AR' study
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Danielle Turton, who led the
OL,7,Fresearch, said the findings were
OL,8,F"fascinating" as she witnessed the
OL,9,Fcenturies-old sound "gradually
OL,10,Fdisappearing" as the younger
OL,11,Fgenerations who took part had much
OL,12,Fweaker tongue movement.
